        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze Mice is part retro maze navigation, part bullet heaven survival, and part chill take-your-time gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385370/extras/9baad3ee192aa1b958a05e15eddbc4c8.poster.avif?t=1779140240\" width=700 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385370/extras/9baad3ee192aa1b958a05e15eddbc4c8.webm?t=1779140240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385370/extras/9baad3ee192aa1b958a05e15eddbc4c8.mp4?t=1779140240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay designed by the same solo developer who brought you Luck be a Landlord.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantastic soundtrack from the same composer as Luck be a Landlord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385370/extras/e0520932e3caf75d732230a0546d884a.poster.avif?t=1779140240\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385370/extras/e0520932e3caf75d732230a0546d884a.webm?t=1779140240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple cute characters to unlock and play as.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385370/extras/b10ef26744d677e24da792bc6efa8b22.poster.avif?t=1779140240\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385370/extras/b10ef26744d677e24da792bc6efa8b22.webm?t=1779140240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385370/extras/b10ef26744d677e24da792bc6efa8b22.mp4?t=1779140240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of upgrades to unlock and pick from.</p></li></ul>",
